sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (Browser)
    participant UI as FastAPI / UI
    participant DB as SQLite DB
    participant W as Background Worker
    participant RAG as RAG Module
    participant PRI as Priority Classifier
    participant PHI as Phishing Detector
    participant EXP as Explain + Verify
    participant GM as Gemini API

    U->>UI: GET /ui/ (open dashboard)
    UI->>DB: SELECT unread emails
    DB-->>UI: Email rows (partial scores)
    UI-->>U: Priority tab HTML

    Note over W: Worker runs in separate thread
    W->>DB: SELECT emails needing analysis
    W->>RAG: compute_embedding(email)
    RAG-->>DB: store embedding
    W->>RAG: retrieve_similar(email)
    RAG->>DB: fetch all embeddings
    DB-->>RAG: embedding array
    RAG-->>W: top-2 similar emails + evidence

    W->>PRI: classify(email, evidence)
    PRI->>GM: relevance score (if key set)
    GM-->>PRI: JSON score
    PRI-->>DB: write priority_score, label, evidence

    W->>PHI: detect(email)
    PHI-->>DB: write fraud_score, label, layer_results

    W->>EXP: generate_and_verify(email)
    EXP->>GM: explanation + decompose claims
    GM-->>EXP: explanation text + claims JSON
    EXP-->>DB: write explanation, verified_claims

    U->>UI: Click expand email row (HTMX)
    UI->>DB: POST /ui/emails/{id}/panel (sets opened_at)
    DB-->>UI: verified_claims, layer_results
    UI-->>U: Expanded panel (Summary, Verified Explanation, Detection Layers)

